1010 0 obj
  << /ActualText (UX\057UI Designer\054 Fintech Startup \050stealth\051\054 Oct 2026\055Present\nOwn the UX\057UI for an early stage fintech product\054 from user flows to final screens\nBuild the UI in code myself with Claude Code\n\nDigital Creative Designer \046 Customer Success\054 Broadcust \050B2B SaaS Startup\051\054 2024\0552026\nProposed and defined a request status experience modeled on real time order tracking \050like Wolt\051\056 Once built\054 overall support inquiries dropped an estimated 20\045\054 per the support team\nProposed replacing a 15\05530 minute discovery call with a self serve digital form and wrote its questionnaire\056 Most clients completed it on their own\nDefined a simpler content request flow \050new request button\054 quick edit\051\056 10\05515\045 of subscribers used it in its launch month\nIdentified key friction points that pushed customers off the platform\054 by analyzing discovery calls\054 onboarding sessions and support tickets\nDesigned responsive landing pages and brand sites for clients\054 using AI tools)
     /K [ 12 ]
     /P 1011 0 R
     /Pg 986 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
